All chip drivers in this directory are lifted verbatim from upstream
Linux at the tag pinned in scripts/lifted-manifest.txt. They're not
vendored in this repository — scripts/fetch-lifted.sh pulls them on
demand into the gitignored chips/lifted/ subdirectory.

Source: torvalds/linux @ <LINUX_TAG>

  drivers/media/dvb-frontends/si2168.{c,h,_priv.h}     → lifted/si2168/
  drivers/media/tuners/si2157.{c,h,_priv.h}            → lifted/si2157/
  drivers/media/dvb-frontends/lgdt3306a.{c,h}          → lifted/lgdt3306a/
  drivers/media/dvb-frontends/mn88472.{c,h,_priv.h}    → lifted/mn88472/
  drivers/media/tuners/tda18250.{c,h,_priv.h}          → lifted/tda18250/

The five drivers cover every chip used by the supported boards:

  - WinTV-dualHD (DVB):       si2168 + si2157
  - WinTV-dualHD 01595 ATSC:  lgdt3306a + si2157
  - Xbox One Tuner:           mn88472 + tda18250

Compiled in userland against linuxdvbkpi/ via
`-include linuxdvbkpi/linuxdvbkpi.h`. No source modifications; fixes
go in the polyfill, not here.

Run `scripts/fetch-lifted.sh` before building.

